    <http://example.org/node/chunk49> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we optimize costs while ensuring the expected service quality? we are financially eligible to bid as we tender eligibility indicates a maximum contract value of 3 million euros, which matches The total contract value, and we have met the minimum turnover threshold. To calculate the projected margin, we first need to determine the annual revenue from this project." ;
