    <http://example.org/node/chunk50> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that The total contract value is 3 million euros over 4 years, the annual revenue from this project would be approximately 750,000 euros per year. Considering we target gross margin percentage of 28 and assuming this project will operate under similar financial conditions as we current projects, we can estimate the projected margin." ;
