    <http://example.org/node/chunk51> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, without specific details on the costs associated with this project, we'll have to consider we general pricing model and cost structure. To optimize costs while ensuring the expected service quality, we should focus on we variable costs, which account for 65% of project costs. focus could involve renegotiating rates with subcontractors, as mentioned in we budget reduction strategies, or exploring more efficient ways to deliver this project without compromising quality." ;
