    <http://example.org/node/chunk52> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that fixed costs account for 35% of project costs, we might also look into streamlining we internal processes to minimize 35% of project costs. It's essential to ensure that any cost optimization does not compromise the service quality expected by the client. streamlining could involve maintaining we standard daily rates for senior personnel while exploring efficiencies in other areas, such as infrastructure or software licensing costs, where we margins are specified at 12% and 8%, respectively." ;
