    <http://example.org/node/chunk59> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with GDPR and other regulatory requirements as specified in The tender, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. existing certifications and capabilities. For GDPR compliance, given our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard data residency is EU-only and our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers outside EU unless there's an explicit legal basis, our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. are already aligned with the requirement of no data transfer outside EU. our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. experience with anonymisation tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models can be utilized to ensure sensitive data is encrypted and protected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk6> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To indicative title, a time of response lower than 2 seconds is expected for the current requests. A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services. An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk60> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "GDPR also requires that data subjects' rights are implemented, which our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have already put in place, including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection rights. our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. capability to perform Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA) with an average duration of 3 weeks can be instrumental in assessing the impact of our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. AI-powered information systems on the protection of personal data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability of AI recommendations, we will need to focus on developing models that provide transparent and interpretable results. developing might involve using techniques such as model interpretability methods or developing post-hoc explanation tools that can justify the recommendations made by our AI-powered information systems. Given the requirement for no automated decision without explicit agent validation, we must implement a review process where human agents validate decisions before decisions are finalized. a review process where human agents validate decisions before they are finalized involves integrating our access control standards, which include multi-factor authentication (MFA) and role-based access control (RBAC), to ensure that only authorized personnel can validate decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our network security architecture patterns, including zero-trust and micro-segmentation, will help in protecting the data and the AI systems from unauthorized access. The experience with intrusion detection and prevention systems (IDS/IPS) and DDoS mitigation will also be crucial in safeguarding we infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, to comply with other regulatory requirements such as the EU AI Act, we need to ensure that our company Nexus Engineering S.r.l. AI systems are designed and developed with security and compliance in mind from the outset. ensure includes adhering to the principles of transparency, fairness, and accountability in AI decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In summary, by leveraging we existing GDPR posture, access control standards, network security measures, and experience with regulatory frameworks, we can implement a solution that meets The tender requirements for strict GDPR compliance and other regulatory needs. implement involves ensuring EU-only data hosting, encrypting sensitive data, providing explainable AI recommendations, requiring explicit agent validation for automated decisions, and adhering to broader regulatory principles governing AI development and deployment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

