    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client expectations, I propose leveraging we expertise in Large Language Models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities. we can deploy a sovereign model like Mistral 7B Instruct, which has strong performance in French-language tasks, to provide intelligent assistance to municipal agents." ;
