    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution will utilize Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, including retrieval strategies such as dense vector semantic search and BM25 sparse retrieval, to contextualize answers based on agent demands. we chunking strategies, like recursive text splitter and semantic chunking, will enable efficient processing of administrative contents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve answer quality and reduce processing times, we can fine-tune Mistral 7B Instructuct model using we preferred methods, such as LoRA or QLoRA, on a domain-specific corpus. fine-tune will allow Mistral 7B Instruct to adapt to the tone and format of municipal administrative contents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can integrate we explainability and trust components, including source citation and chain-of-thought display, to provide transparent and reliable outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Confidence scoring will also be implemented to ensure that The solution displays uncertainty warnings when necessary and escalates to human supervisors." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we can draw from we current research topics, such as knowledge graphs for procedural reasoning and multi-agent collaboration frameworks, to enhance The solution capabilities and facilitate future developments. we typical V1 to V2 development cycle of 9 months will allow we to iterate and refine The solution based on user feedback and performance metrics." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we AI components and innovation strategy, we can deliver a comprehensive solution that meets the client's requirements and provides significant value to municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints In the framework of City of Belval policy of sustainable development, City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of City of Belval systems of information. The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of the energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact. 9. Modalities of deployment the project will have to be conducted in a progressive manner, with: a pilot phase on a limited scope, a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can The City of Belval ensure that a solution contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact meets these sustainability requirements and reduces the environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The City of Belval systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The holder will have to propose a solution contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
