    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure that a solution contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact meets these sustainability requirements and reduces the environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these sustainability requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can propose a solution that leverages Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, which utilize 100% renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation and auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, can also reduce energetic consumption by approximately 35% compared to our baseline." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. green IT hardware procurement policy ensures that equipment has a minimum lifecycle of 5 years, further reducing electronic waste." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By implementing these measures, we can contribute to the reduction of energetic consumption and minimize the environmental impact of a solution contributing to the reduction of energetic consumption and relying, as much as possible, on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "### Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., in consortium with Nexus Engineering S.r.l. specialized agents, is pleased to submit a comprehensive tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in the City of Belval. a comprehensive tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in the City of Belval leverages Nexus Engineering S.r.l. expertise in AI/ML systems, GDPR compliance, security, and sustainability to deliver a high-quality solution that meets the client's requirements. ### Understanding of Requirements Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have carefully reviewed the call for tenders and understand the need for an intelligent assistance tool that can facilitate access to information, improve answer quality, and reduce processing times. Nexus Engineering S.r.l. acknowledge the regulatory constraints, including GDPR compliance, data protection, and explainability of AI recommendations. a comprehensive tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in the City of Belval addresses the regulatory constraints, including GDPR compliance, data protection, and explainability of AI recommendations while ensuring a high level of availability, security, and sustainability. ### Proposed Solution an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in the City of Belval utilizes a cloud-native design leveraging Outscale's SecNumCloud infrastructure, which meets the sovereignty requirement of hosting data within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

